      en: ["Founded in 1516 by King Christian II.", "Headquarters of the supercar manufacturer Koenigsegg.", "Home to a famous UFO monument from 1946.", "Features a 6 km long sandy beach at Skälderviken.", "Location of the Swedish Railway Museum.", "The Rönne å river flows through the city center."],
