      en: ["Founded in 1582 by King John III.", "Commonly nicknamed 'Glada Hudik' (Happy Hudik).", "Famous for the historic red warehouses by the harbor.", "Major hub for the global fiber optic industry.", "Nearly entirely destroyed by Russian troops in 1721.", "Home to the regional Hälsingland Museum."],
