      en: ["Holy Cross Church dates back to the 12th century", "Site of the Ronneby Bloodbath in the year 1564", "Ronneby Brunnspark repeatedly voted Sweden's most beautiful park", "Former significance as one of Sweden's primary spa resorts", "Located in Blekinge, known as the Garden of Sweden", "Major hub for IT companies and technical research"],
